// title: KQL to check Privilege Admin failing Microsoft CA MFA enforcement
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Identity
// tables: IdentityInfo, SigninLogs
// purpose: KQL to check Privilege Admin failing Microsoft CA MFA enforcement
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/KQL%20to%20check%20Privilege%20Admin%20failing%20Microsoft%20CA%20MFA%20enforcement.kql
// kind: repo
